Package: obus
Title: Implementing More and Better Use of ICES Survey Data
Version: 2026.08
Authors@R: person("Einar", "Hjorleifsson", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com")
Maintainer: Einar Hjörleifsson <einar.hjorleifsson@gmail.com>
Description: Lazy access to the DATRAS trawl-survey archive, and the derived
    catch tables obus builds from it. Field names and the raw archive root come
    from the sibling 'opus' package; obus adds the haul key, the species
    lookup, and the length-frequency and haul-summary catch tables.
License: CC BY 4.0
Encoding: UTF-8
